Aristotle. English edition with introduction by J. A. Smith. Project Gutenberg ebook 8438; the retained digital front matter does not name the translator.

[Retained EPUB](../books/aristotle-nicomachean-ethics.epub) · [Original book and publication notices](https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/8438). English. Project Gutenberg identifies this edition as public domain in the USA; its notices and production credits remain in the retained file.

Used passages: Books I–II for happiness and character; Book III, chapters 1–5 for action and deliberation; Book VI for practical wisdom; Books VIII–IX for friendship; Book X, chapters 6–8 for optional comparison concerning contemplation. [First guide](../aristotle/Living-well-and-character.lingua#r_21YB00AWNRYQ0X2SQ8H0RFRW65) and [practical judgment guide](../aristotle/Practical-wisdom-and-friendship.lingua#r_6RZXS4EJH55PRPW61MB33DTCNM).

